#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# personal profile
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Installed on top of the base Brewfile when PROFILE="personal" in config.sh.
# Tracked, so a replacement personal machine reproduces from here.
#
# What belongs here: anything you want on every machine you own, and would not
# want installed on an employer-managed one. Anything that suits only a single
# machine belongs in Brewfile.local instead, which is gitignored.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

